{"id":1332,"date":"2026-03-10T13:43:55","date_gmt":"2026-03-10T20:43:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?page_id=1332"},"modified":"2026-03-10T13:43:55","modified_gmt":"2026-03-10T20:43:55","slug":"cs280a-proj3","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/cs280a-proj3\/","title":{"rendered":"Stitching Photo Mosaics"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Part A: IMAGE WARPING and MOSAICING<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>A.1 Shoot the Pictures<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For this project, I captured three sets of images from the game <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/en.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Gujian_3\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#0693e3\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Gujian 3 (\u53e4\u5251\u5947\u8c2d\u4e09<\/mark>)<\/a><\/strong>, focusing on its three major city environments: <strong>Yanling (\u9122\u9675)<\/strong>, <strong>Yangping (\u9633\u5e73)<\/strong>, and <strong>Tianlu City (\u5929\u9e7f\u57ce)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This game is well known for its richly detailed environments and traditional Chinese architectural aesthetics, making it a great source for scenes with clear geometric structure and consistent perspective cues.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Using in-game screenshots provides several practical advantages for this task:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The <strong>camera center can be fixed<\/strong> precisely while rotating, ensuring pure projective (perspective) transformations without translation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Lighting and object motion<\/strong> can be frozen through in-game settings, eliminating temporal inconsistencies between images.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The <strong>environments feature distinctive visual depth and texture<\/strong>, which improves feature detection and alignment quality.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Overall, these three scenes represent a range of architectural and environmental styles typical of the game\u2019s world, while also satisfying the technical requirements for projective image mosaicking.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Yanling (\u9122\u9675)<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\" data-attachment-id=\"833\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=833\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_2.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,375\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"yanling_2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_2.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"833\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_2.jpg?resize=600%2C375&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-833\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_2.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_2.jpg?resize=300%2C188&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\" data-attachment-id=\"827\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=827\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_1.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,375\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"yanling_1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_1.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"827\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_1.jpg?resize=600%2C375&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-827\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_1.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_1.jpg?resize=300%2C188&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\" data-attachment-id=\"832\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=832\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_3.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,375\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"yanling_3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_3.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"832\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_3.jpg?resize=600%2C375&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-832\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_3.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yanling_3.jpg?resize=300%2C188&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Yangping (\u9633\u5e73)<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\" data-attachment-id=\"828\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=828\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yangping_1.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,375\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;