wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\" data-attachment-id=\"826\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=826\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_1.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,375\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"tianlucheng_1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_1.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"826\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_1.jpg?resize=600%2C375&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-826\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_1.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_1.jpg?resize=300%2C188&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\" data-attachment-id=\"830\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=830\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_2.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,375\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"tianlucheng_2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_2.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"830\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_2.jpg?resize=600%2C375&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-830\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_2.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_2.jpg?resize=300%2C188&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\" data-attachment-id=\"829\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=829\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_3.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,375\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"tianlucheng_3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_3.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"829\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_3.jpg?resize=600%2C375&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-829\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_3.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/tianlucheng_3.jpg?resize=300%2C188&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>A.2 Recover Homographies<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before warping the images, I compute the <strong>projective transformation<\/strong> (homography) between each pair of images.<br>A homography defines a mapping between two planes and can be written as:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>p&#8217; = H p<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>p =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>x \\<br>y \\<br>1<br>\\end{bmatrix},<br>\\quad<br>p&#8217; =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>x&#8217; \\<br>y&#8217; \\<br>1<br>\\end{bmatrix},<br>\\quad<br>H =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>h_{11} &amp; h_{12} &amp; h_{13} \\\\<br>h_{21} &amp; h_{22} &amp; h_{23} \\\\<br>h_{31} &amp; h_{32} &amp; 1<br>\\end{bmatrix}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">with matrix multiplication, we can get:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\begin{cases}<br>x h_{11} + y h_{12} + h_{13} &#8211; x x&#8217; h_{31} &#8211; y x&#8217; h_{32} = x&#8217; \\\\<br>x h_{21} + y h_{22} + h_{23} &#8211; x y&#8217; h_{31} &#8211; y y&#8217; h_{32} = y&#8217;<br>\\end{cases}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Since <em><strong>H<\/strong><\/em> has 8 degrees of freedom (the last entry can be fixed to 1), I rearrange the above into a <strong>linear system<\/strong> of the form <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>A h = b<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>A =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>x &amp; y &amp; 1 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; -x x&#8217; &amp; -y x&#8217; \\\\<br>0 &amp; 0 &amp; 0 &amp; x &amp; y &amp; 1 &amp; -x y&#8217; &amp; -y y&#8217;<br>\\end{bmatrix},<br>\\quad<br>b =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>x&#8217; \\\\<br>y&#8217;<br>\\end{bmatrix}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here we have two equations, by selecting 4 correspondences for a pair of image, we can get the eight equations for solving <em><strong>H<\/strong><\/em>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I manually selected 10 point correspondences for each image pair using <code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#cf2e2e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">matplotlib.ginput<\/mark><\/code>. With more than four points, the system <em><strong>Ah=b<\/strong><\/em> becomes overdetermined, and is therefore solved in the <strong>least-squares sense<\/strong> to minimize reprojection error:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\min_h | A h &#8211; b |^2<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Below are some examples of the correspondences:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"5908\" height=\"3081\" data-attachment-id=\"841\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/a_1-tianlu-img1-2\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A_1-Tianlu-img1-edited.png?fit=5908%2C3081&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"5908,3081\" data-comments-opened=\"0\