w to make a facade looks more &#8220;front&#8221;:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\" data-attachment-id=\"834\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=834\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yangping_3.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,375\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"yangping_3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yangping_3.jpg?fit=600%2C375&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yangping_3.jpg?resize=600%2C375&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-834\" style=\"width:474px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yangping_3.jpg?w=600&amp;ssl=1 600w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/yangping_3.jpg?resize=300%2C188&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"408\" height=\"409\" data-attachment-id=\"895\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=895\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?fit=408%2C409&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"408,409\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A3 facade\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?fit=408%2C409&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?resize=408%2C409&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-895\" style=\"width:476px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?w=408&amp;ssl=1 408w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?resize=400%2C400&amp;ssl=1 400w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?resize=200%2C200&amp;ssl=1 200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A3-facade-1.png?resize=50%2C50&amp;ssl=1 50w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>A.4: Blend the Images into a Mosaic<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After warping the images into the same projection, the next step is to blend them smoothly into a single mosaic.<br>Directly overlaying one image on top of another would result in visible seams and hard boundaries.<br>To address this, I implemented a <strong>weighted averaging blending<\/strong> method that uses <strong>distance transform masks<\/strong> to achieve smooth transitions between overlapping regions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The function allows three inputs: a list of images, a list of movements, and a list of masks. All the movements and masks can be returned from the warping step.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-code\">\n\t<div class=\"cm-editor\">\n\t\t<div class=\"cm-scroller\">\n\t\t\t\n<pre><code><div class=\"cm-line\">def multiple_blending(images, movements, alphas):<\/div><\/code><\/pre>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here I use the blending process of these two images as an illustration example:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"794\" height=\"258\" data-attachment-id=\"897\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=897\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_before.png?fit=794%2C258&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"794,258\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A4_before\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_before.png?fit=794%2C258&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_before.png?resize=794%2C258&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-897\" style=\"width:912px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_before.png?w=794&amp;ssl=1 794w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_before.png?resize=300%2C97&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_before.png?resize=768%2C250&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 794px) 100vw, 794px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The steps of blending are as follows:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 1: Create the canvas<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I first computed the overall bounding box of the final mosaic by checking the spatial extents of both warped images.<br>Then, a series of canvases were created with this final size, and the warped images were placed on them according to the relative displacement <code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#cf2e2e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">movements<\/mark><\/code>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br><strong>Step 2: Mask construction<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For each image, I generated a <strong>binary mask<\/strong> representing the valid pixel regions of the image. The mask value is <code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#cf2e2e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">True<\/mark><\/code> for pixels that belong to the image and <code><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#cf2e2e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">False<\/mark><\/code> for the empty regions. The mask is generated from the warping process.<br>These masks are essential for identifying where the two images overlap and where each image should contribute intensity values.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"950\" height=\"281\" data-attachment-id=\"900\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=900\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_mask.png?fit=950%2C281&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"950,281\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A4_mask\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_mask.png?fit=950%2C281&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_mask.png?resize=950%2C281&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-900\" style=\"width:923px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_mask.png?w=950&amp;ssl=1 950w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_mask.png?resize=300%2C89&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_mask.png?resize=768%2C227&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 3: Distance transform<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Instead of using a hard binary boundary, I computed a <strong>distance transform<\/strong> on each mask using:<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-code\">\n\t<div class=\"cm-editor\">\n\t\t<div class=\"cm-scroller\">\n\t\t\t\n<pre><code><div class=\"cm-line\">from scipy.ndimage import distance_transform_edt<\/div><div class=\"cm-line\">dist1=distance_transform_edt(mask)<\/div><\/code><\/pre>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This operation assigns each pixel a value proportional to its distance from the nearest edge of the mask. Intuitively, pixels near the center of an image have a large distance value (strong confidence), while those near the edges have small distance values (weak confidence).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 4: Alpha Weight Computation<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From these distance maps, I calculated a <strong>soft blending weight<\/strong> for each image:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\alpha_1 = \\frac{d_1^2}{d_1^2 + d_2^2 + \\varepsilon},<br>\\qquad<br>\\alpha_2 = 1 &#8211; \\alpha_1<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 5: Weighted blending<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Finally, the two aligned images were blended using the computed alpha weights:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>I_{\\text{blend}} = \\alpha_1 I_1 + \\alpha_2 I_2<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Note that in <strong>step 2<\/strong>, bringing in the <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#cf2e2e\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><code>alpha<\/code><\/mark> mask calculated from the warping process help reduces the feather looking when blending:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-1 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"950\" height=\"281\" data-attachment-id=\"899\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=899\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_compare.png?fit=950%2C281&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"950,281\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A4_compare\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_compare.png?fit=950%2C281&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"899\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_compare.png?resize=950%2C281&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-899\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_compare.png?w=950&amp;ssl=1 950w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_compare.png?resize=300%2C89&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_compare.png?resize=768%2C227&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 950px) 100vw, 950px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Results<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here are the final blended mosaics of the three cities from <em>Gujian 3<\/em>. They are perfectly blended!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-1 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-8 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"794\" height=\"389\" data-attachment-id=\"912\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=912\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_yanling.png?fit=794%2C389&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"794,389\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A4_yanling\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_yanling.png?fit=794%2C389&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"912\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_yanling.png?resize=794%2C389&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-912\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_yanling.png?w=794&amp;ssl=1 794w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_yanling.png?resize=300%2C147&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_yanling.png?resize=768%2C376&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 794px) 100vw, 794px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"794\" height=\"371\" data-attachment-id=\"911\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=911\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Yangping.png?fit=794%2C371&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"794,371\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A4_Yangping\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Yangping.png?fit=794%2C371&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"911\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Yangping.png?resize=794%2C371&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-911\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Yangping.png?w=794&amp;ssl=1 794w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Yangping.png?resize=300%2C140&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Yangping.png?resize=768%2C359&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 794px) 100vw, 794px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"794\" height=\"355\" data-attachment-id=\"910\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=910\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Tianlu.png?fit=794%2C355&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"794,355\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A4_Tianlu\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Tianlu.png?fit=794%2C355&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"910\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Tianlu.png?resize=794%2C355&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-910\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Tianlu.png?w=794&amp;ssl=1 794w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Tianlu.png?resize=300%2C134&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A4_Tianlu.png?resize=768%2C343&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 794px) 100vw, 794px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>A.5: Bells &amp; Whistles<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cylindrical Mapping<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Instead of mapping each image directly onto a plane, this method projects every pixel onto the surface of a cylinder of radius equal to the focal length <strong><em>f<\/em><\/strong>, and then unwraps the cylinder onto a flat image.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 1: Normalize the coordinates<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Each pixel <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=%28x%2C+y%29&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"(x, y)\" class=\"latex\" \/> is first expressed relative to the image center:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>X = \\frac{x &#8211; c_x}{f}, \\qquad Y = \\frac{y &#8211; c_y}{f}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 2: Project to the cylindrical surface<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The mapping from image plane to cylinder is:<br>$$<br>x_c = f \\tan(X), \\qquad y_c = \\frac{fY}{\\cos(X)}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This bends horizontal lines while preserving vertical ones, reducing distortion across wide mosaics.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 3: Inverse mapping for sampling<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For each output pixel <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=%28x_c%2C+y_c%29&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"(x_c, y_c)\" class=\"latex\" \/>, the source coordinate in the original image is computed as:<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>x = f \\arctan!\\left(\\frac{x_c}{f}\\right) + c_x, \\qquad<br>y = f \\frac{y_c}{\\sqrt{x_c^2 + f^2}} + c_y<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 4: Mask and assignment<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This step is exactly the same as <strong>Steps 4 and 5<\/strong> in part <strong>A.3 Warp the images<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Below shows the results. They present a stronger visual impact!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-1 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-9 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"794\" height=\"451\" data-attachment-id=\"920\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=920\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yanling-1.png?fit=794%2C451&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"794,451\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A5_Yanling\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yanling-1.png?fit=794%2C451&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"920\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yanling-1.png?resize=794%2C451&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-920\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yanling-1.png?w=794&amp;ssl=1 794w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yanling-1.png?resize=300%2C170&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yanling-1.png?resize=768%2C436&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 794px) 100vw, 794px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"794\" height=\"409\" data-attachment-id=\"919\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=919\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yangping-1.png?fit=794%2C409&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"794,409\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A5_Yangping\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yangping-1.png?fit=794%2C409&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"919\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yangping-1.png?resize=794%2C409&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-919\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yangping-1.png?w=794&amp;ssl=1 794w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yangping-1.png?resize=300%2C155&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_Yangping-1.png?resize=768%2C396&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 794px) 100vw, 794px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"794\" height=\"411\" data-attachment-id=\"918\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=918\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_tianlu-1.png?fit=794%2C411&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"794,411\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"A5_tianlu\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_tianlu-1.png?fit=794%2C411&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"918\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_tianlu-1.png?resize=794%2C411&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-918\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_tianlu-1.png?w=794&amp;ssl=1 794w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_tianlu-1.png?resize=300%2C155&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/A5_tianlu-1.png?resize=768%2C398&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 794px) 100vw, 794px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Part B: FEATURE MATCHING for AUTOSTITCHING<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This part is for auto stitching the images together. This part follows the algorithm and parameter in the paper &#8220;<em><a href=\"https:\/\/cal-cs180.github.io\/fa25\/hw\/proj3\/Papers\/MOPS.pdf\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/cal-cs180.github.io\/fa25\/hw\/proj3\/Papers\/MOPS.pdf\">Multi-Image Matching using Multi-Scale Oriented Patches<\/a><\/em>&#8220;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>B.1 Harris Corner Detection<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Harris Interest Point Detector<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To detect feature points in an image, I first applied the Harris Corner Detector, which identifies locations with strong intensity variations in both x and y directions. These points are typically corners that are robust to translation and rotation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Harris response function is defined as:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>R = \\frac{\\det(M)}{\\text{trace}(M)}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where M is the second moment matrix at each pixel:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>M =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>I_x^2 &amp; I_x I_y \\\\<br>I_x I_y &amp; I_y^2<br>\\end{bmatrix}<br>$$<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">and <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=I_x&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"I_x\" class=\"latex\" \/>\u200b and <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=I_y&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"I_y\" class=\"latex\" \/>\u200b are image gradients in the x and y directions, respectively.<br>Pixels with a large R are considered good corner candidates.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I used the provided <code>get_harris_corners()<\/code> function to compute both the Harris response matrix h and the coordinates of the detected corners. Points that are close to the boundary are not taken into account to avoid window conflict in later steps. The corners are then overlaid on the original image for visualization:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"515\" height=\"350\" data-attachment-id=\"936\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=936\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_harris.png?fit=515%2C350&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"515,350\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B1_harris\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_harris.png?fit=515%2C350&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_harris.png?resize=515%2C350&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-936\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.4715363004583764;width:433px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_harris.png?w=515&amp;ssl=1 515w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_harris.png?resize=300%2C204&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 515px) 100vw, 515px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Adaptive Non-Maximal Suppression (ANMS)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While Harris corners indicate strong interest points, they tend to cluster densely in textured regions. Adaptive Non-Maximal Suppression (ANMS) helps spread the corners more evenly by selecting a subset of keypoints that are both strong and spatially well-distributed.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The idea is to assign each corner a suppression radius <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=r_i&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"r_i\" class=\"latex\" \/>, defined as the minimum distance to any other corner <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=j&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"j\" class=\"latex\" \/> that has a significantly higher Harris response:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>r_i = \\min_j |x_i &#8211; x_j| \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad h_j &gt; c_\\text{robust} \\cdot h_i<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where <\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=h_i&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\"h_i\" class=\"latex\" \/>\u200b is the Harris response of corner <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+i+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" i \" class=\"latex\" \/>,<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+c_%7B%5Ctext%7Brobust%7D%7D++&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" c_{&#92;text{robust}}  \" class=\"latex\" \/> is a robustness factor (here used 0.9).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After computing all <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+r_i+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" r_i \" class=\"latex\" \/>, the algorithm keeps the n corners with the largest radii,which are the most spatially distinctive keypoints. The below two images shows their ANMS corners (500 points for each image). Compared to the harris corners in the previous section, these images have points that are distributed more evenly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-10 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"515\" height=\"330\" data-attachment-id=\"934\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=934\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms.png?fit=515%2C330&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"515,330\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B1_anms\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms.png?fit=515%2C330&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"934\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms.png?resize=515%2C330&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-934\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms.png?w=515&amp;ssl=1 515w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms.png?resize=300%2C192&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 515px) 100vw, 515px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"515\" height=\"330\" data-attachment-id=\"935\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=935\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms2.png?fit=515%2C330&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"515,330\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B1_anms2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms2.png?fit=515%2C330&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"935\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms2.png?resize=515%2C330&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-935\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms2.png?w=515&amp;ssl=1 515w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B1_anms2.png?resize=300%2C192&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 515px) 100vw, 515px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>B.2 Feature Descriptor Extraction<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After identifying a set of well-distributed corner points using <strong>Harris<\/strong> and <strong>ANMS<\/strong>, I extracted a feature descriptor for each corner to characterize its local appearance. Each descriptor is computed from a blurred 40\u00d740 image patch, which is then subsampled to an 8\u00d78 vector and bias\/gain normalized.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The steps for each corner coordinate <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+%28x_i%2C+y_i%29+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" (x_i, y_i) \" class=\"latex\" \/>:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 1: <\/strong>Apply Gaussian smoothing to the image before sampling:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>I_\\text{blurred} = I * G_\\sigma<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">where <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+G_%5Csigma+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" G_&#92;sigma \" class=\"latex\" \/>\u200b is a Gaussian kernel with standard deviation <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+%5Csigma+%3D+1.0&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" &#92;sigma = 1.0\" class=\"latex\" \/> as used as the pyramid sigma in the paper.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 2: <\/strong>Extract a 40\u00d740 window centered at the corner.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 3:<\/strong> Subsample every 5 pixels to get an 8\u00d78 patch.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 4:<\/strong> Normalize the descriptor to remove illumination bias: <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>I&#8217; = \\frac{(I &#8211; \\mu)}{\\sigma + \\epsilon}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"841\" height=\"350\" data-attachment-id=\"957\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=957\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B2_on_image.jpg?fit=841%2C350&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"841,350\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B2_on_image\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B2_on_image.jpg?fit=841%2C350&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B2_on_image.jpg?resize=841%2C350&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-957\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B2_on_image.jpg?w=841&amp;ssl=1 841w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B2_on_image.jpg?resize=300%2C125&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B2_on_image.jpg?resize=768%2C320&amp;ssl=1 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 841px) 100vw, 841px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>B.3 Feature Matching<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After extracting 8\u00d78 feature descriptors from both images, I implemented feature matching using Lowe\u2019s ratio test to identify pairs of features that are most likely to correspond between two images.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For each descriptor <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+d_i+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" d_i \" class=\"latex\" \/> in image 1, we find its two nearest neighbors <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+d_j+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" d_j \" class=\"latex\" \/> and <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+d_k+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" d_k \" class=\"latex\" \/> in image 2, based on <strong>Euclidean (L2) distance<\/strong>:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>d_{ij} = | d_i &#8211; d_j |_2<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Lowe\u2019s ratio test compares the distance of the closest match to the second-closest match:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\text{ratio}_i = \\frac{| d_i &#8211; d_j |_2}{| d_i &#8211; d_k |_2}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Only matches that satisfy:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\text{ratio}_i &lt; T<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">are retained, where T is the threshold (here picked 0.3).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This ensures that the best match is significantly better than the next candidate, reducing ambiguous correspondences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Below shows three pairs of correspondences:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-1 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-11 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"321\" data-attachment-id=\"962\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=962\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature.png?fit=1182%2C370&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1182,370\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B3_feature\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature.png?fit=1024%2C321&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"962\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature.png?resize=1024%2C321&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-962\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature.png?resize=1024%2C321&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature.png?resize=300%2C94&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature.png?resize=768%2C240&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature.png?w=1182&amp;ssl=1 1182w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"321\" data-attachment-id=\"964\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=964\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature2.png?fit=1182%2C370&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1182,370\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B3_feature2\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature2.png?fit=1024%2C321&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"964\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature2.png?resize=1024%2C321&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-964\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature2.png?resize=1024%2C321&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature2.png?resize=300%2C94&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature2.png?resize=768%2C240&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature2.png?w=1182&amp;ssl=1 1182w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"321\" data-attachment-id=\"963\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=963\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature3.png?fit=1182%2C370&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1182,370\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B3_feature3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature3.png?fit=1024%2C321&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"963\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature3.png?resize=1024%2C321&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-963\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature3.png?resize=1024%2C321&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature3.png?resize=300%2C94&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature3.png?resize=768%2C240&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B3_feature3.png?w=1182&amp;ssl=1 1182w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>B.4 RANSAC for Robust Homography<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">RANSAC Algorithm<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To achieve robust image alignment, I used a 4-point RANSAC scheme to estimate the homography between each image and the reference frame. This removes the influence of outlier matches that arise from false correspondences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 1:<\/strong> Random sampling: pick 4 matching pairs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 2: <\/strong>Estimate a temporary homography <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+H_i+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" H_i \" class=\"latex\" \/>\u200b using these 4 pairs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 3:<\/strong> Project all points from image 1 using <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/s0.wp.com\/latex.php?latex=+H_i+&#038;bg=ffffff&#038;fg=000&#038;s=0&#038;c=20201002\" alt=\" H_i \" class=\"latex\" \/>\u200b:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\tilde{\\mathbf{x}}&#8217; = H_i\\,\\tilde{\\mathbf{x}},\\quad<br>\\tilde{\\mathbf{x}}&#8217; \\leftarrow<br>\\frac{1}{\\tilde{z}&#8217;}(\\tilde{x}&#8217;,\\tilde{y}&#8217;,1)<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 4:<\/strong> Count inliers whose reprojection error is within a tolerance \ud835\udf0f:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>| \\mathbf{x&#8217;} &#8211; \\tilde{\\mathbf{x}}&#8217; |_2 &lt; \\tau<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Below shows the result of auto warping (middle) and manual warping (right). They return almost the same result with slight differences:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"232\" data-attachment-id=\"968\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=968\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_warp_compare.png?fit=1415%2C321&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1415,321\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B4_warp_compare\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_warp_compare.png?fit=1024%2C232&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_warp_compare.png?resize=1024%2C232&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-968\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_warp_compare.png?resize=1024%2C232&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_warp_compare.png?resize=300%2C68&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_warp_compare.png?resize=768%2C174&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_warp_compare.png?resize=1200%2C272&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_warp_compare.png?w=1415&amp;ssl=1 1415w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Blending<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Then I used the same blending technique as part A.4 to all the blending images. Each blended images is generated from three screenshots of the city:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-1 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-12 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"250\" data-attachment-id=\"967\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=967\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_1.png?fit=1415%2C346&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1415,346\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B4_1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_1.png?fit=1024%2C250&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"967\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_1.png?resize=1024%2C250&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-967\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoy