tps:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_2.png?resize=768%2C180&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_2.png?resize=1200%2C281&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_2.png?w=1415&amp;ssl=1 1415w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"227\" data-attachment-id=\"965\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=965\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_3.png?fit=1415%2C314&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1415,314\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B4_3\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_3.png?fit=1024%2C227&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"965\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_3.png?resize=1024%2C227&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-965\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_3.png?resize=1024%2C227&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_3.png?resize=300%2C67&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_3.png?resize=768%2C170&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_3.png?resize=1200%2C266&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B4_3.png?w=1415&amp;ssl=1 1415w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>B.5 Bells &amp; Whistles: Rotation Invariance<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To make the feature descriptors robust to image rotation, I extended the previous axis-aligned implementation by aligning each patch according to its dominant gradient orientation. This ensures that the same physical corner produces similar descriptors even when the image is rotated.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 1:<\/strong> Extract a local window around the point (40\u00d740 pixels).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 2:<\/strong> Compute image gradients in the x and y directions:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>G_x = \\frac{\\partial I}{\\partial x}, \\quad G_y = \\frac{\\partial I}{\\partial y}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 3:<\/strong> Estimate the dominant orientation from the summed gradient vectors:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>\\theta = \\arctan2!\\left(\\sum G_y,\\, \\sum G_x\\right)<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 4: <\/strong>Rotate the patch by \u2212\u03b8 so that the dominant direction is aligned horizontally.<br>Rotation is performed using the affine transform:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>M =<br>\\begin{bmatrix}<br>\\cos\\theta &amp; -\\sin\\theta &amp; 0\\\\<br>\\sin\\theta &amp; \\cos\\theta &amp; 0<br>\\end{bmatrix}<br>$$<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Step 5:<\/strong> Subsample and normalize the rotated patch to obtain an 8\u00d78 descriptor:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">$$<br>D&#8217; = \\frac{D &#8211; \\mu(D)}{\\sigma(D) + \\epsilon}<br>$$<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Below shows some examples of random rotational descriptors in three different images:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-13 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"430\" data-attachment-id=\"978\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/shaoyiwang.com\/?attachment_id=978\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B5_all_1.png?fit=640%2C430&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"640,430\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"B5_all_1\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B5_all_1.png?fit=640%2C430&amp;ssl=1\" data-id=\"978\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B5_all_1.png?resize=640%2C430&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-978\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B5_all_1.png?w=640&amp;ssl=1 640w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/shaoyiwang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/B5_all_1.png?resize=300%2C202&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"436\" dat